      "sha256": "sha256:cd6678df8b8338e028f144b9f5db56f29130d9ada68156dba7c89ba67777caf3",
      "observation": "Dated aerial from the Greenwich side shows the two eastern core cells, a lower western excavation, orange-railed timber decks, crane at the Vesey edge and twin colored mechanical vents on the Fulton-facing part of the old service building."
    },
    {
      "page": "https://www.explorewtc.com/en/local/learn-about-wtc/t2-construction.html",
      "observation": "The Port Authority records the September transit lobby closure and construction of the tower above the pre-existing foundations."
    }
